# Copy this file to `.env` (which is gitignored) and fill in a key.
# ai-review.sh sources whichever of reviewer/.env or capstones/domain3/.env it finds.
#
# Option A (recommended for CI / unattended runs): direct API billing.
#   Gives a real per-run dollar figure in the gate output (total_cost_usd).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Option B (low-friction, uses your Claude subscription): skip the key above and
# instead run `claude /login` once. Those credentials persist for the CLI, so
# the gate will authenticate without a key. Note: subscription auth may report
# cost as $0.00 in the gate output — confirm before quoting a dollar figure.
#
# Fail-on threshold: high (default) | medium | low
# REVIEW_FAIL_ON=high
